      "text": "导数与函数的单调性、极值、最值",
      "children": [
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "导数的概念",
          "children": [
            {
              "line": 4,
              "text": "定义：$f'(x_0)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{f(x_0+\\Delta x)-f(x_0)}{\\Delta x}$"
            },
            {
              "line": 5,
              "text": "几何意义：曲线在 $x_0$ 处切线的斜率"
            },
            {
              "line": 6,
              "text": "切线方程：$y-f(x_0)=f'(x_0)(x-x_0)$"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "text": "常用求导公式",
          "fold": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "line": 8,
              "text": "$(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$"
            },
            {
              "line": 9,
              "text": "$(\\sin x)'=\\cos x$"
            },
            {
              "line": 10,
              "text": "$(\\cos x)'=-\\sin x$"
            },
            {
              "line": 11,
              "text": "$(e^x)'=e^x$"
            },
            {
              "line": 12,
              "text": "$(\\ln x)'=\\frac{1}{x}$"
            },
            {
              "line": 13,
              "text": "四则运算：$(uv)'=u'v+uv'$"
            },
            {
              "line": 14,
              "text": "复合函数：$[f(g(x))]'=f'(g(x))g'(x)$"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 15,
          "text": "单调性",
          "id": "mono",
          "children": [
            {
              "line": 16,
              "text": "$f'(x)>0$ 则 $f(x)$ 在该区间单调递增"
            },
            {
              "line": 17,
              "text": "$f'(x)<0$ 则 $f(x)$ 在该区间单调递减"
            },
            {
              "line": 18,
              "text": "步骤：定义域、求导、解不等式、写区间"
            },
            {
              "line": 19,
              "text": "已知单调求参：转化为 $f'(x)\\ge 0$ 或 $\\le 0$ 恒成立",
              "color": "red"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 20,
          "text": "极值",
          "id": "extreme",
          "children": [
            {
              "line": 21,
              "text": "左正右负：极大值点"
            },
            {
              "line": 22,
              "text": "左负右正：极小值点"
            },
            {
              "line": 24,
              "text": "必要条件：$f'(x_0)=0$"
            },
            {
              "line": 25,
              "text": "易错：$f'(x_0)=0$ 不一定是极值点",
              "color": "red"
            },
            {
              "line": 26,
              "text": "极值是局部概念，可以有多个"
            }
          ],
